      "chosen": ["Manage water resources by using drip irrigation, mulching, and implementing rainwater harvesting systems.", "Studies show that these techniques significantly reduce water use and increase water use efficiency in agriculture.", "Techniques include soil moisture monitoring, using cover crops to reduce evaporation, and constructing swales for water conservation."],
      "rejected": ["Sustainable water management is too complex for small farms.", "Just rely on rainfall; additional techniques aren't necessary.", "There are no scientifically supported techniques for sustainable water management."]
    },
