      "prompt": ["How to protect crops from extreme weather using organic methods?", "Scientific evidence on organic adaptations to climate change?", "Organic farming practices for weather resilience?"],
      "chosen": ["Protect crops by using mulch to conserve moisture, selecting drought-tolerant varieties, and implementing windbreaks.", "Studies indicate that organic farming practices can enhance resilience to climate extremes through improved soil health and biodiversity.", "Practices include adjusting planting dates, using shade cloths or row covers, and conserving water through efficient irrigation systems."],
